  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The daevic can access veils in an unusual way, attaching them to his very life essence. In addition to his unique Blood veils, the daevic can use his Blood slot to shape and bind Neck, Head, Headband or Body slot veils; however, when using this slot for non-Blood veils, he takes a number of points of damage equal to twice the amount of essence invested each round. He takes this damage at the start of his turn, and immediately after any time he reassigns essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/daevic#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
